(window.BOOK_MODULES = window.BOOK_MODULES || {})[9] = {"n": 9, "title": "Implied and Omitted Governing Elements", "ar": "العَامِلُ المَعْنَوِيُّ وَحَذْفُ العَامِلِ", "lessons": [{"key": "0", "title": "Introduction", "short": "Introduction", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L0-s1\">Before you begin</h2><p>An ending can be explained even when no written word assigns it. Sometimes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> is a grammatical relationship; sometimes a particular <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> is understood from the construction. Learn to distinguish these explanations, identify the evidence, and give a complete <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> without inventing unnecessary words.</p><p>Recall <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل، معمول، مبتدأ، خبر، فاعل، مفعول به، مصدر، حال، مضاف، مضاف إليه</span></b>. A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span></b> describes the state of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب الحال</span></b>. A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span></b> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> expressing or reinforcing the action of its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صَبَرْتُ صَبْرًا</span></b>, “I remained patient.” A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير عائد</span></b> refers back to an earlier expression.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Term</th><th>What to establish</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل معنوي</span></td><td>A relationship or meaning does the grammatical work</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل محذوف</span></td><td>A particular unspoken expression is required by the analysis</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span></td><td>The wording supplied to explain that relationship</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span></td><td>Evidence in the context or construction</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب / جائز / راجح</span></td><td>Required / permitted / preferred; these are different judgements</td></tr></tbody></table><p>For every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>, ask: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما موقعه؟ ما عامله؟ وما الدليل؟</span></b> Distinguish <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب لفظًا</span></b> from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب</span></b>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> may mark <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> rather than <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>.</p><p>Each question or table row has one correct choice. Work out the reason before selecting, then press Check and consult the worked solution. When more than one analysis is valid, the question specifies the intended analysis or asks you to recognise the alternatives.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L0-s1", "title": "Before you begin"}], "items": []}, {"key": "1", "title": "Explaining endings through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العامل المعنوي</span>", "short": "Lesson 1", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s1\">Three kinds of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span></h2><p>A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل لفظي</span></b> is an expression such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span></b>. A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل معنوي</span></b> works through a relationship or meaning. Use these three accounts:</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل معنوي</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span></th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الابتداء</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع المبتدأ والخبر</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خَالِدٌ مُعَلِّمٌ</span>.</b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلوّ المضارع عن ناصب وجازم</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع المضارع</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَكْتُبُ خَالِدٌ</span>.</b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الفعل في الاسم أو الحرف</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب الحال</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تِلْكَ بُيُوتُهُمْ خَاوِيَةً</span>.</b></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلوّ</span></b> means absence: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبُ</span> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span> here. This is a positive explanation of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>, not a missing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span>. In the first row, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الابتداء</span></b> explains both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوعات</span>. Another recognised account assigns <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع المبتدأ</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الابتداء</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع الخبر</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبتدأ</span>. Keep the two accounts separate; use the first unless told otherwise.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s2\">Recognise <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الفعل</span></h2><table><thead><tr><th>Expression</th><th>Understood meaning that can govern <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الإشارة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أُشيرُ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أدوات الاستفهام</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَسألُ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أدوات التشبيه</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أُشبّهُ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أدوات التمنّي والترجّي</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَتمنّى / أَرجو</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف التنبيه</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أُنبّهُ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الظرف المستقرّ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استقرّ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The expression keeps its own word type. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كأنّ</span></b> remains a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى التشبيه</span> can explain a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> alongside its usual work in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمها وخبرها</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَأَنَّ خَالِدًا مُقْبِلًا أَسَدٌ</span></b>: “Khalid, as he approaches, is like a lion.” <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم كأنّ</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسدٌ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبرها</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبلًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>, governed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى أُشبّه</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تِلْكَ بُيُوتُهُمْ خَاوِيَةً</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Those are their houses, empty. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خاوية</span></b> = empty.</span></div><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تلك</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة مبني في محل رفع مبتدأ</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيوتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع بالضمة، وهو مضاف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خاويةً</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوب بالفتحة، وعامله معنى الإشارة</span>. It describes the houses' state; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيوتهم</span> already supplies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>.</li></ul><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى أُشير</span> explains the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span> of the existing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة</span>. It does not require you to insert a separate written <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> into the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L1-s1", "title": "Three kinds of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span>"}, {"id": "L1-s2", "title": "Recognise <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الفعل</span>"}, {"id": "L1-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "1G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل معنوي</span> to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span>. Use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الابتداء</span> for both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبتدأ والخبر</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الابتداء يرفع المبتدأ والخبر</span> under the selected account. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلوّ المضارع عن ناصب وجازم</span> explains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع المضارع. معنى الفعل</span> can govern <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب الحال</span>; it does not give every following word the same ending.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الابتداء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب الحال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم المضارع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع المبتدأ والخبر</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلوّ المضارع عن ناصب وجازم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ الاسم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب المضارع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع المضارع</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الفعل في الاسم أو الحرف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم فعلين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب الحال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع كل اسم بعده</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "1G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تلك بيوتهم خاويةً</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تلك</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة مبني في محل رفع مبتدأ</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيوتُ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع ومضاف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خاويةً</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوب يبيّن حالة البيوت، وعامله معنى أُشير في اسم الإشارة. بيوتهم</span> already supplies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تلك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة في محل رفع مبتدأ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل محذوف</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيوتهم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيوتِ مجرور بتلك</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيوتُ خبر مرفوع ومضاف؛ هم مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيوتَ مفعول به؛ هم فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خاويةً</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع بفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوب، عامله معنى الإشارة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه لبيوت</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "1I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Supply the endings and reasons in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ سعيد. سعيد معلم</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأُ سعيدٌ. سعيدٌ معلّمٌ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأُ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span> because there is no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ</span> in the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ</span>. In the second, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمٌ خبر</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الابتداء</span> explains both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> endings under the specified account.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأُ: مضارع مرفوع لخلوّه من ناصب وجازم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأْ: مجزوم بلم محذوفة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأَ: منصوب لأن سعيد بعده</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٍ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ: فاعل مرفوع بالفعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدًا: مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد معلم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ فاعل لمعلمٍ المجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ مبتدأ ومعلمٌ خبر؛ رفعهما بالابتداء في التحليل المختار</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدًا ومعلمًا مفعولان</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "1I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct: “In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كأنّ خالدًا مقبلًا أسدٌ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبلًا</span> is another <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم كأنّ</span>.”", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم كأنّ منصوب؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسدٌ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر كأنّ مرفوع؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبلًا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوب</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>, governed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى أُشبّه</span>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> alone does not make it <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم كأنّ</span>.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "opts": ["Correct: every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كأنّ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمها</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبلًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> governed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى التشبيه</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم كأنّ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسدٌ خبرها</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقبلًا</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> because it follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "1R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ معلّمٌ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ خالدًا معلّمٌ</span></b>. What changes?", "sol": "<p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ معلّمٌ</span></b>, use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الابتداء</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ خالدًا معلّمٌ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span> is an expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل لفظي: خالدًا اسمها منصوب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمٌ خبرها مرفوع</span>. Do not invent an omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span> in the first.</p>", "group": "1R|Review", "opts": ["The first uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الابتداء</span>; the second has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل لفظي</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمها وخبرها</span>.", "Both require a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف إنّ</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّم</span> becomes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> in the second because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span> only permits one <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "1-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يرتفع المضارع لخلوّه من الناصب والجازم</span>.</b> Which analysis follows this?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلوّ</span></b> means absence. In the stated setting, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكتبُ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع</span>. No omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span> is being posited.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكتبُ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span> when no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span> governs it.", "A missing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span> makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكتب منصوبًا</span>.", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكتب</span> must be preceded by a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف لم</span>."], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "2", "title": "Sharing a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span> and recovering an omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>", "short": "Lesson 2", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s1\">More than one <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> seeks a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التنازع</span></b>, also called <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإعمال</span></b>, occurs when two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عوامل</span> seek one <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول متأخّر</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عوامل</span> may be two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span> or two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء عاملة</span>. More than two can also share this relationship.</p><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كُلُوا وَاشْرَبُوا مِنْ رِزْقِ اللهِ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Eat and drink from Allah's provision. The following <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من رزق الله</span></b> relates in meaning to both actions. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَقَرِيبٌ أَمْ بَعِيدٌ مَا تُوعَدُونَ؟</span></b>: Is what you are promised near or far? <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قريب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعيد</span> both seek the following expression.</span></div><p>Either the first or the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> may be selected for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعمال</span>. Meaning shared between two actions is not an instruction to assign the same written <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span> two independent endings. State which <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> your chosen analysis uses. The exercises here practise identifying the relationship and following a specified choice.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s2\">Recovering a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> from context</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحذف الجائز</span></b> is supported by <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة السياق</span></b>. In answer to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَاذَا قَرَأْتَ؟</span></b>: “What did you read?”: say <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كِتَابًا</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَرَأْتُ كِتَابًا</span></b>. The question supplies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعولًا به</span>, not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> merely because it stands alone.</p><p>Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحذف الواجب</span></b>: a particular construction requires the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> to remain unspoken. Giving its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> during <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> explains the structure; it does not mean it should be inserted into that construction.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَتَبْتُ وَقَرَأْتُ الرِّسَالَةَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I wrote and read the letter. Use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعمال الثاني</span></b>.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتُ، قرأتُ</span></b>: each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماضٍ مبني على السكون، والتاء ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالةَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة لقرأت</span>. The same letter is understood as what was written; the selected <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> of the expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأت</span>.</p><p>Now <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماذا كتبتَ؟: رسالةً</span>.</b> Here <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالةً</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لفعل محذوف جوازًا تقديره كتبتُ</span>. There are not two expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عوامل</span> competing: this is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحذف الجائز</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L2-s1", "title": "More than one <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> seeks a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span>"}, {"id": "L2-s2", "title": "Recovering a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> from context"}, {"id": "L2-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "2G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Identify the relationships in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتُ وقرأتُ الرسالةَ</span></b>, using <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعمال الثاني</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتُ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span> both seek <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالة</span> in meaning. The expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span> follows them. With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعمال الثاني</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالةَ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لقرأت؛</span> its relation to writing remains understood. This choice does not deny that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعمال الأول</span> is another permitted account.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العاملان</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالة والتاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو والرسالة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتُ وقرأتُ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعمول المتأخّر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء في كتبتُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالةَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل الرسالةَ المختار</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الابتداء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتُ وحده مع إعمال الأول</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "2G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماذا قرأتَ؟: كتابًا</span>.</b> Choose the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> and role.", "sol": "<p>The question asks what was read, so the matching <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ كتابًا</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا</span> retains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب المفعول به</span>. The question is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة السياق</span>, making the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف جائزًا</span>.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا كتابُ؛ كتابًا منادى مبني على الضم</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ كتابًا؛ كتابًا مفعول به لفعل محذوف جوازًا</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا كتابٌ؛ كتابًا مبتدأ منصوب</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "2I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقريبٌ أم بعيدٌ ما تُوعَدون؟</span></b>, what shows that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التنازع</span> is not confined to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span>?", "sol": "<p>The two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء عاملة قريب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعيد</span> seek <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما توعدون</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التنازع</span> may involve <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء</span> as well as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span>, and more than two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عوامل</span> can occur in the broader pattern.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> must be a third <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قريب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعيد</span> are both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحرف جرّ</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قريب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعيد</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمان عاملان</span> seeking the following expression."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "2I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Read <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماذا كتبتَ؟ قال خالد: رسالةً</span>.</b> Analyse the final answer.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالةً</span></b> answers <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماذا كتبتَ</span>, so its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتُ</span></b> understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جوازًا</span>. It is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لقال: خالدٌ</span> already fills that role. The exact context, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> alone, identifies the omitted action.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالةً: مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالةٌ: فاعل لقال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالةٍ: مضاف إليه لخالد</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير العامل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم أكتبْ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة الحذف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["The mere presence of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>", "The fact that every answer omits a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل وجوبًا</span>", "The preceding question about writing"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "2R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which distinction between <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل معنوي</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل محذوف</span> is accurate?", "sol": "<p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل معنوي</span> need not be reconstructed as a separate word. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف عامل</span> has a suitable <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> grounded in evidence. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الابتداء</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتُ</span></b> are therefore different explanations.</p>", "group": "2R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الابتداء</span> is a relationship; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتُ</span> in the answer <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالةً</span> is an unspoken <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> recovered from context.", "Both are always omitted forms of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كان</span>.", "Neither can explain an ending unless printed in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "2-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجوز إعمال الأول أو الثاني في التنازع</span>.</b> What must an exercise asking for one selected <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> make clear?", "sol": "<p>Both selections are permissible. A specified choice makes the requested <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> unambiguous; shared meaning alone does not identify one required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["That <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعمال الأول</span> is always forbidden.", "Whether it is using <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعمال الأول</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعمال الثاني</span>.", "That both must independently assign different endings to the same word."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "3", "title": "When the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول المطلق</span> is omitted", "short": "Lesson 3", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s1\">Identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> and its purpose</h2><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> of a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span></b> may be <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوفًا وجوبًا</span></b>. Some patterns are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قياسيّة</span></b>, recognised by their <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>; others are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سماعيّة</span></b>, learned as established expressions. Do not label every isolated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قياسيّ</span> pattern</th><th>Example</th><th>What it does</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نهي</span> following a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> intended as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صَبْرًا لَا جَزَعًا</span></b></td><td>Be patient; do not panic</td></tr><tr><td>After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام للتوبيخ</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَجُرْأَةً عَلَى المَعَاصِي؟</span></b></td><td>Rebukes audacity in committing sins</td></tr><tr><td>After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إمّا</span>, detailing an earlier general statement</td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فَإِمَّا مَنًّا بَعْدُ وَإِمَّا فِدَاءً</span></b></td><td>Separates the alternatives: release freely or ransom</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأكيد مضمون الجملة</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أُولَئِكَ هُمُ المُؤْمِنُونَ حَقًّا</span></b></td><td>Reinforces the preceding assertion</td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزع</span></b> = panic; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرأة</span></b> = audacity; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعاصي</span></b> = sins; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضمون</span></b> = the meaning expressed by a whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>. In the first pattern, notice the following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نهي</span>, not just the existence of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> used for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span>. In the third, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إمّا</span> introduces a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفصيل</span> tied to what precedes; it does not itself assign <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s2\">Established expressions</h2><p>Recognise <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سُبْحَانَ اللهِ، مَعَاذَ اللهِ، عَجَبًا لَكَ، حَمْدًا وَشُكْرًا لَا كُفْرًا</span></b>. Each uses a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> is understood. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معاذ الله</span></b> means seeking Allah's protection; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عجبًا لك</span></b> expresses wonder.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَبَّيْكَ، سَعْدَيْكَ، حَنَانَيْكَ، دَوَالَيْكَ، حَذَارَيْكَ</span></b> are established <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصادر</span> in a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة مثنّى</span> used for <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التكثير</span></b>, repeated or abundant action, not a literal count of two. Learn these forms rather than generating new ones freely. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لبّيك</span>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> marks <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> is absent because of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ك</span>.</p><p>For <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأكيد مضمون الجملة</span>, also recognise <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بَتًّا، بَتَاتًا، بَتَّةً، البَتَّةَ</span></b> and the recorded <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَلْبَتَّةَ</span></b>: the last two differ in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة الوصل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة القطع</span>. Their use reinforces certainty; it does not create a new rule for every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سُبْحَانَ اللهِ</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبحانَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق منصوب بالفتحة لفعل محذوف وجوبًا، وهو مضاف</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> expresses <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أُسبّحُ</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span> explains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب سبحان</span>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> explains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ الله</span>. These are two separate relationships.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L3-s1", "title": "Identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> and its purpose"}, {"id": "L3-s2", "title": "Established expressions"}, {"id": "L3-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "3G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each example to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قياسيّ شرط</span>.", "sol": "<p>The four <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نهي تابع لمصدر يراد به الأمر؛ استفهام للتوبيخ؛ تفصيل بعد إمّا؛ تأكيد مضمون الجملة</span></b>. The relevant <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل محذوف وجوبًا. إمّا</span> itself is not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span>.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صبرًا لا جزعًا: لا جزعًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختصاص بعد ضمير</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء عَلَم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نهي تابع لمصدر يراد به الأمر</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجرأةً على المعاصي؟</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام للتوبيخ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استغاثة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فإمّا منًّا بعدُ وإمّا فداءً</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ترخيم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين عوض عن جملة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفصيل بعد إمّا لمجمل سابق</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أولئك هم المؤمنون حقًّا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لاسم فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأكيد مضمون الجملة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال سدّت مسدّ الخبر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "3G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبحانَ اللهِ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبحانَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق منصوب بالفتحة لفعل محذوف وجوبًا، وهو مضاف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهِ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>. The construction is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سماعيّ</span>; its two endings come from different relationships.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبحانَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق منصوب، وهو مضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى مبني على الضم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العامل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظ الجلالة عامل في سبحان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل محذوف وجوبًا بمعنى أسبّح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ ظاهر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "3I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct: “<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لبّيك</span> means exactly two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span>, because it has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة مثنّى</span>.”", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لبّيك</span></b> and its related established <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصادر</span> use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة مثنّى للتكثير</span>. Here <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة نصب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> is removed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للإضافة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ك</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. It is not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span>.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "opts": ["Correct: every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة مثنّى</span> must count exactly two actions.", "Its established <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة مثنّى</span> conveys <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التكثير</span>, not a literal count of two.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لبّيك</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع مجزوم بحذف النون</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "3I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Supply the roles in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معاذ الله. عجبا لك</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معاذَ اللهِ</span></b> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span> with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف عامل</span> conveying seeking protection; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معاذَ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهِ مضاف إليه</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عجبًا لك</span></b> likewise uses a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف عامل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لك</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ك في محل جر</span>. These are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سماعيّ</span> expressions.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معاذ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معاذُ: خبر مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معاذِ: مجرور بلا عامل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معاذَ: مفعول مطلق ومضاف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الله</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهِ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهُ: فاعل لمعاذ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهَ: مفعول مطلق</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عجبا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عجبٍ: مضاف إليه للكاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عجبٌ: منادى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عجبًا: مفعول مطلق بعامل محذوف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام حرف نصب؛ الكاف فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام حرف جرّ؛ الكاف في محل جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ك اسم ظاهر منصوب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "3R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتُ رسالةً</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبحانَ اللهِ</span></b>. Why is matching <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> insufficient?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالة</span> names what was written and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به. سبحان</span> expresses the action through a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>. Both have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>; their roles and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عوامل</span> differ.</p>", "group": "3R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسالةً</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبحانَ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل محذوف</span>.", "Both must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> because something follows them.", "Both must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span> because they are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "3-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يحذف عامل المفعول المطلق وجوبًا، قياسًا أو سماعًا</span>.</b> Choose the correct application.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام للتوبيخ</span> supplies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قياسيّ شرط</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجرأةً. سبحان الله</span> is learned as an established <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سماعيّ</span> expression. Neither account justifies universal deletion for all <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصادر</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سماعيّ</span> permits inventing any new expression with the same apparent ending.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل مصدر منصوب</span> has an omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل وجوبًا</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجرأةً على المعاصي؟</span> meets a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قياسيّ شرط</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبحان الله</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سماعيّ</span> expression."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "4", "title": "Warning with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحذير</span>", "short": "Lesson 4", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s1\">Meaning and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أركان</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحذير</span></b> directs someone to avoid something harmful or disliked. In the shortened construction, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> by a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل محذوف</span> conveying <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">احذرْ، باعدْ، تجنّبْ، قِ، توقَّ</span></b> or a suitable equivalent. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قِ</span></b> means “protect”; it is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وَقَى</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ركن</span></th><th>Identify it</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل التحذير المقدّر</span></td><td>The understood action of warning or avoiding</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المُحذِّر</span></td><td>The speaker giving the warning</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المُحذَّر</span></td><td>The person addressed</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المُحذَّر منه</span></td><td>What that person should avoid</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Keep <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُحذِّر</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُحذَّر</span> distinct: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ر</span> change who is meant.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s2\">Three ways to express it</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Form</th><th>Examples</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُحذَّر</span> expressed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير منصوب منفصل</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إِيَّاكَ وَالحَسَدَ</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إِيَّاكَ إِيَّاكَ المِرَاءَ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُحذَّر</span> expressed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَفْسَكَ</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَفْسَكَ نَفْسَكَ</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَفْسَكَ وَالحَسَدَ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُحذَّر منه</span> expressed directly</td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحَسَدَ الحَسَدَ</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحَسَدَ وَالبَغْضَاءَ</span></b></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحسد</span></b> = envy; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المراء</span></b> = contentious disputing; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البغضاء</span></b> = hatred. The repeated word gives <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span> gives <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span></b> in the analyses used here.</p><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُحذَّر منه</span> can instead follow <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِنْ</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إِيَّاكَ مِنَ الحَسَدِ</span></b>. It is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور لفظًا</span> after the expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِن</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إِيَّاكَ أَنْ تَحْسُدَ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِن</span> is understood before <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن تحسد</span></b>, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر مؤوّل. أن</span> still makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحسدَ منصوبًا</span>; do not assign that ending to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّاك</span>.</p><p>The shortened patterns use a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف عامل</span>. Warning as a meaning can also occur with an expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>, such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قُوا أَنْفُسَكُمْ وَأَهْلِيكُمْ نَارًا</span></b>. Thus “a warning always lacks a written <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>” is too broad. Keep the construction and the communicative purpose distinct.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحَسَدَ الحَسَدَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Beware of envy!</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحسدَ الأول</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بفعل محذوف وجوبًا تقديره احذرْ؛ فاعله مستتر تقديره أنت</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحسدَ الثاني</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي منصوب</span>. The second occurrence reinforces the same warning; it does not introduce a second danger.</p><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّاك والحسدَ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّاك</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير منفصل في محل نصب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحسدَ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف منصوب</span> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span> analysis. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> conveys keeping yourself away from envy.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L4-s1", "title": "Meaning and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أركان</span>"}, {"id": "L4-s2", "title": "Three ways to express it"}, {"id": "L4-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "4G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "A teacher warns a student against envy. Match the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أركان</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المحذِّر</span></b> gives the warning; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المحذَّر</span></b> receives it; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المحذَّر منه</span></b> is what should be avoided. The understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">احذرْ</span> supplies the action. Speaker and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى</span> are not interchangeable.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المُحذِّر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["The student addressed", "The teacher speaking", "Envy"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المُحذَّر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["The teacher speaking", "Envy", "The student addressed"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المُحذَّر منه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["The student addressed", "The teacher speaking", "Envy"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل التحذير المقدّر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ابتداء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">احذرْ</span> or a suitable equivalent", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف النداء</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "4G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Compare the two forms.", "sol": "<p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحسدَ الحسدَ</span></b>, the first is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لفعل محذوف وجوبًا</span> and the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي منصوب</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّاك من الحسدِ</span></b>, the expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحسد</span>. The meaning of warning does not force every word into <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحسدَ الحسدَ</span>: first word", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لفعل محذوف تقديره احذر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز لعدد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحسدَ الحسدَ</span>: second word", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لفعل جديد</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّاك من الحسدِ: الحسد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالابتداء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بإيّاك</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بمن</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "4I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعرب</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إياك من المراء</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المراء</span> = contentious disputing.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّاك</span></b> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير منفصل في محل نصب</span>, with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف عامل</span> conveying the warning. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المراءِ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بالكسرة، وهو المحذَّر منه</span>. Separate the semantic role <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المحذَّر منه</span> from its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ</span> in this particular form.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّاك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير منفصل في محل نصب في التحذير</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المراء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المراءِ: اسم مجرور بمن، وهو المحذّر منه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المراءَ: منصوب مع وجود من</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المراءُ: فاعل ظاهر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "4I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّاك أن تحسدَ</span></b>: which analysis preserves the two relationships?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مصدري ونصب؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحسدَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب بالفتحة، فاعله مستتر أنت. أن تحسد</span> forms a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر مؤوّل</span> before which <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span> is understood in this warning pattern. A warning meaning is not itself a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span>.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن</span> makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحسدَ منصوبًا</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِن</span> is understood before the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر المؤوّل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّاك</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب للمضارع</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحسد</span> must become <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزومًا</span> because the meaning is a warning."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "4R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct: “Any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> giving a warning must have its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> omitted.”", "sol": "<p>The meaning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحذير</span> also occurs with an expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قوا أنفسكم وأهليكم نارًا</span></b>. Distinguish the shortened construction being analysed from every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> whose purpose is to warn.</p>", "group": "4R|Review", "opts": ["The shortened constructions use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span>, but warning can also use an expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قُوا</span>.", "Correct: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قُوا</span> cannot express warning because it is written.", "Warning always requires a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "4-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المحذَّر منه ما يحذّر المتكلّم المخاطَب منه</span>.</b> In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّاك والحسدَ</span></b>, using the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span> analysis, identify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحسد</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحسد</span></b> is what the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى</span> should avoid: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المحذَّر منه</span>. With the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span> analysis, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحسدَ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف منصوب</span>, while <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّاك</span> names the person addressed through a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المحذِّر؛ فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المحذَّر منه؛ معطوف منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المحذَّر؛ ضمير منفصل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "5", "title": "Encouraging with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإغراء</span> and specifying with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاختصاص</span>", "short": "Lesson 5", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s1\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإغراء</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإغراء</span></b> urges someone to do something desirable. Its understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> can be <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الزمْ، اطلبْ، خذْ، افعلْ</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أركان</span> are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل الإغراء المقدّر، المُغري</span></b> (speaker), <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المُغرَى</span></b> (person addressed), and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المُغرَى به</span></b> (the desirable action or quality).</p><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصَّبْرَ الصَّبْرَ</span>!</b> <span class=\"gl\">Keep to patience! <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العِلْمَ وَالحِلْمَ</span>!</b>: Pursue knowledge and forbearance! <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حلم</span></b> = self-restraint or forbearance.</span></div><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف العامل</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب</span></b> when the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُغرَى به</span> is repeated or has another expression <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف عليه</span>. A single unrepeated <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصبرَ</span>!</b> does not meet those two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> merely because it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إغراء</span>. The encouragement can also use a written <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>, as in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خُذِ الكِتَابَ بِقُوَّةٍ</span></b>.</p><p>Related established expressions include <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَرْحَبًا، أَهْلًا وَسَهْلًا</span></b>, analysed here with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصبتَ</span></b>: you have found welcome, friendly people, and ease. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امْرَأً وَنَفْسَهُ</span></b> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دَعْ</span></b>, “leave a person to himself.” Follow this analysis rather than assigning every familiar greeting the same role by appearance.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاختصاص</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاختصاص</span></b> specifies who is intended by an earlier <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>. The specifying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بفعل محذوف وجوبًا</span>, such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخصُّ</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعني</span></b>.</p><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَحْنُ الطُّلَّابَ نَطْلُبُ العِلْمَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">We, the students, seek knowledge.</span></div><p>The speaker is already included in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن. الطلابَ</span> identifies that group; nobody is being summoned. Contrast <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا طلابُ</span></b> addressed to a particular group: that is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء</span>.</p><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختصاص</span> can also use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّها / أيّتها</span></b> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span>, with the corresponding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحكام النداء</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحنُ أيُّها الطلابُ نطلبُ العلمَ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم في محل نصب</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ها</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للتنبيه</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلابُ</span> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصف مرفوع</span>. Do not add <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> and still claim that the construction is unchanged.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَحْنُ الطُّلَّابَ نَطْلُبُ العِلْمَ</span>.</b></div><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير منفصل مبني في محل رفع مبتدأ</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلابَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة لفعل محذوف وجوبًا تقديره أخصُّ، على الاختصاص</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نطلبُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع بالضمة؛ فاعله مستتر تقديره نحن</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة نطلب العلم</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر</span>. The intervening <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختصاص</span> does not replace that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>.</li></ul></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L5-s1", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإغراء</span>"}, {"id": "L5-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاختصاص</span>"}, {"id": "L5-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "5G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Distinguish purpose and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصبرَ الصبرَ</span> urges patience and contains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكرار. العلمَ والحلمَ</span> urges two desirable qualities with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span>. Both have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل محذوف وجوبًا</span>. The <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُغري</span></b> speaks, the <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُغرَى</span></b> is addressed, and the <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُغرَى به</span></b> is what is urged.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصبرَ الصبرَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء نكرة مقصودة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إغراء؛ حذف العامل واجب للتكرار</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحذير من الصبر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمَ والحلمَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إغراء؛ حذف العامل واجب مع العطف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلاهما مرفوع بالابتداء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة معنوية</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المُغرَى به</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["The speaker", "The person addressed", "The desirable quality or action urged"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "5G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن الطلابَ نطلبُ العلمَ</span></b> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختصاص</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ. الطلابَ</span> specifies that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختصاص</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل محذوف وجوبًا تقديره أخصّ. نطلبُ مضارع فاعل مرفوعه مستتر نحن؛ العلمَ مفعول به. جملة نطلب العلم</span> supplies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع مبتدأ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نداء</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلابَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر نحن منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لفعل محذوف تقديره أخصّ، على الاختصاص</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى مع يا مكتوبة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نطلب العلم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي للطلاب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل رفع خبر</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "5I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A speaker includes himself: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن المعلمينَ نعلّمُ الصغارَ</span></b>. Choose the analysis of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلمين</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمينَ</span></b> identifies the group meant by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن: اختصاص</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير أخصّ</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعني</span>. It is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بالياء لأنه جمع مذكر سالم</span>. The speaker is not summoning the teachers; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة نعلّم الصغار</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصغار</span></b> = children.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع بالياء</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى مبني على الواو لأن يا موجودة</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختصاص؛ مفعول به منصوب بالياء لأنه جمع مذكر سالم، بعامل محذوف</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "5I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the correction or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span>.", "sol": "<p>A single <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصبرَ</span> does not satisfy <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكرار</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span> merely by being <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إغراء</span>. The established greetings use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير أصبتَ</span> here; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امرأً ونفسه</span> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دعْ. أيّها</span> can introduce <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختصاص</span> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا: أيّ مبني على الضم في محل نصب، ها للتنبيه، والطلاب وصف مرفوع</span>.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "“Single <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصبرَ</span>! meets the repetition <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>.”", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصبر</span> must be a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>.", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إغراء</span> is repeated even when written once.", "It is unrepeated; that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> is absent."], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرحبًا، أهلًا وسهلًا: تقدير</span> used here", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أدعو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصبتَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم تكتبْ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امرأً ونفسَه: تقدير</span> used here", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخصّ نحن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دَعْ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن أيّها الطلاب نطلب العلم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختصاص</span> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استغاثة</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام مفتوحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ندبة</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "5R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحسدَ الحسدَ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصبرَ الصبرَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>The structural pattern includes a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف عامل</span> and a repeated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span>. The intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> differs: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">احذر الحسد</span> versus <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الزم الصبر</span>. Meaning distinguishes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحذير</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإغراء</span>.</p>", "group": "5R|Review", "opts": ["Both begin with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لفعل محذوف</span>; the first warns away, the second urges toward.", "Both call named people and are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء</span>.", "The first is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>, but the second must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "5-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاختصاص يعيّن المراد من الضمير قبله</span>.</b> Which detail establishes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاختصاص</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن الطلابَ نطلب العلم</span></b>?", "sol": "<p>Look back to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلابَ</span> clarifies its intended group with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف أخصّ</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعني</span>. No <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نداء</span> appears, and the construction does not govern <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلابَ</span> assigns <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نطلب</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلابَ</span> identifies the group already referred to by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلابَ</span> is being called from a distance by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span>."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "6", "title": "Tracking the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاشتغال</span>", "short": "Lesson 6", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s1\">Find the three <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أركان</span></h2><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاشتغال</span></b>, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> comes before a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> already working in a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> that refers back to it. If freed from that work, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> could assign <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> to the earlier <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>. The construction is also called <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما أُضمر عامله على شريطة التفسير</span></b>: its unspoken <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> must be explained by what follows.</p><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكِتَابَ قَرَأْتُهُ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">The book, I read it.</span></div><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ركن</span></th><th>Here</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المشغول،</span> also <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المشتغل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span>: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> already occupied</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المشغول به</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span>: the returning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المشغول عنه</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span>: the earlier <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لفعل محذوف وجوبًا يفسّره المذكور, تقديره قرأتُ</span>. The expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span> works in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span>. Do not make <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> two independent <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> of this one expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>.</p><p>With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span></b>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابُ قرأتُهُ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابُ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة قرأته</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر</span>. No <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف فعل</span> is needed to assign <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span>, because it is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s2\">Choose according to the construction</h2><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> before or within <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاشتغال</span></th><th>Judgement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أداة خاصة بالاسم</span>, such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا الفجائية</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجوب الرفع</span></td></tr><tr><td>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أداة خاصة بالفعل</span>, such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هلّا للتحضيض</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ للشرط</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجوب النصب</span></td></tr><tr><td>The following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل طلب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجحان النصب</span></td></tr><tr><td>A preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة فعلية</span> favours a matching structure</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجحان النصب</span></td></tr><tr><td>A preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span> commonly enters on a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل: ما النافية</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة الاستفهام</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجحان النصب</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Examples help distinguish the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>:</p><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دخلتُ فإذا الكتابُ يحملُهُ خالدٌ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا الفجائية</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع الكتابُ</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> returns to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ الجَنَّةَ تُرِدْهَا فاعملْ صالحًا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ الشرطية</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب الجنّةَ</span> in this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاشتغال</span> pattern. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تُرِدْ</span></b> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم</span> form of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تريدُ</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجنة</span> = Paradise.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقرأُ الكتابَ والرسالةَ أكتبُها</span></b>: the preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة فعلية</span> favours <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب الرسالةَ</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الكتابَ أتركُهُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما النافية</span> favours <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب الكتابَ</span>.</li></ul><p>Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هَلَّا الكِتَابَ قَرَأْتَهُ؟</span></b> with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَالكِتَابَ قَرَأْتَهُ؟</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هلّا</span> in this pattern; it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راجح</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة الاستفهام</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ اقرأْهُ</span></b> likewise has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجحان النصب</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اقرأ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل طلب. راجح</span> does not mean the alternative is forbidden.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s3\">A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> must fit the relationship</h2><p>Sometimes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف فعل</span> has a corresponding meaning rather than repeating the same word. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وَالظَّالِمِينَ أَعَدَّ لَهُمْ عَذَابًا أَلِيمًا</span></b>, the suitable <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أوعدَ الظالمين</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كافأَ الظالمين</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعدّ</span> in this meaning connects the people through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ل</span>, while its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عذابًا</span>. Simply inserting <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعدّ</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الظالمين</span> loses that distinction. An alternative analysis estimates a removed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب بنزع الخافض</span>; keep it separate from the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> used here.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرِّسَالَةَ كَتَبْتُهَا</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالةَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بفعل محذوف وجوبًا تقديره كتبتُ، يفسّره المذكور</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماضٍ مبني على السكون؛ التاء فاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ها</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل نصب مفعول به يعود إلى الرسالة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة كتبتها</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفسيرية لا محل لها من الإعراب</span> in this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> analysis.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L6-s1", "title": "Find the three <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أركان</span>"}, {"id": "L6-s2", "title": "Choose according to the construction"}, {"id": "L6-s3", "title": "A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> must fit the relationship"}, {"id": "L6-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "6G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أركان</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ قرأتُهُ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل قرأت</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المشغول</span></b>. It already works in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span></b>, the <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشغول به</span></b> returning to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span></b> is the earlier <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشغول عنه</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء الفاعل</span> refers to the reader, not the book.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المشغول</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المشغول به</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء بوصفها ضمير الكتاب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المشغول عنه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "6G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> to the strength of its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حكم</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا الفجائية</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خاصة بالاسم</span>, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب. هلّا للتحضيض</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خاصة بالفعل</span> in this pattern, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب. فعل طلب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة الاستفهام</span> favour <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> without making <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> forbidden. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ الشرطية</span> also requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> in the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاشتغال</span> pattern; a preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة فعلية</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما النافية</span> favours it.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا الفجائية</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجوب الرفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجحان النصب فقط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجوب النصب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هلّا للتحضيض</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجوب النصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ بالكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجوب الرفع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "With a following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل طلب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجوب الرفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النصب ممنوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجحان النصب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة الاستفهام</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجوب النصب في كل حال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ الاسم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجحان النصب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "6I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعرب</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالة كتبتها</span></b>, taking <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالة</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاشتغال</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالةَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب لفعل محذوف وجوبًا تقديره كتبتُ، يفسّره المذكور</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتُ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماضٍ مبني على السكون؛ التاء فاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ها</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به يعود إلى الرسالة</span>. The expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفسيرية</span> in this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> account. With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالةُ</span> instead, it would supply <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر المبتدأ</span>.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالةِ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالةَ: مفعول به لفعل محذوف يفسّره المذكور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالةُ: مبتدأ</span> in the requested <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> analysis"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر؛ التاء مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماضٍ؛ التاء فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ها</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به للفعل المذكور، يعود إلى الرسالة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل للفعل المذكور</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة كتبتها</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر في تحليل النصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر بالإضافة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفسيرية لا محل لها في تحليل النصب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "6I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why not simply estimate <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعدّ الظالمين</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">والظالمين أعدّ لهم عذابًا أليمًا</span></b>?", "sol": "<p>In the expressed construction <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعدّ</span> works directly in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عذابًا</span> and links the people by <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لهم</span></b>. A suitable <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف فعل</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أوعدَ</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كافأَ</span></b>, preserving the relevant meaning and relationship. The alternative with an estimated removed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ل</span> is a separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب بنزع الخافض</span> account.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "opts": ["Because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الظالمين</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوعًا بالواو</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعدّ</span> connects the people through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ل</span> here; estimate a corresponding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أوعدَ</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب الظالمين</span>.", "Because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعدّ</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "6R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا</span></b> answering <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماذا قرأتَ؟</span> with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ قرأتُهُ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>The short answer recovers <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span> from the question and permits its expression. In the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب الاشتغال</span> account, the later <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُه</span> explains the unspoken <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ</span> while working itself in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span>. The two kinds of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span> differ.</p>", "group": "6R|Review", "opts": ["Both have the same written <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span> as the direct <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span>.", "Neither needs any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span> for its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span>.", "Both have a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف عامل</span>; the first uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة السياق</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جائز حذف</span>, the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفسير</span> by the expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب حذف</span> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> account."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "6-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المشغول به ضمير عائد على المشغول عنه</span>.</b> In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرسَ حفظتُهُ</span></b>, choose the correct relation.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span></b> refers to the lesson, so it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المشغول به</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرس</span></b> is the earlier <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشغول عنه</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حفظتُ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المشغول</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ت</span> refers to the person who memorised the lesson.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرس</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> returning to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المشغول به</span> and returns to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرس</span>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المشغول عنه</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ت</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المشغول به</span> and returns to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرس</span>."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "7", "title": "Calling someone and analysing the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنادى</span>", "short": "Lesson 7", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s1\">Meaning and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحرف النداء</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النداء</span></b> calls someone using a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span> that stands in place of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أدعو</span></b>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أركان</span> are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل النداء المحذوف، حرف النداء، المنادى</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لأدعو, منصوب</span> either <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظًا</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محلًّا</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحرف النداء</span></th><th>Use</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهمزة، أَيْ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للقريب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَعَبْدَ اللهِ، أَيْ عَبْدَ اللهِ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا، آ، أيا، هيا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للبعيد</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَا عَبْدَ اللهِ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للندبة</span>: calling with grief</td></tr></tbody></table><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> is the form used most often in the practice. Calling itself does not give you permission to remove <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> in every setting.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s2\">Classify before choosing the ending</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Type of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حكم</span></th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب لفظًا</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا عبدَ اللهِ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبيه بالمضاف</span>: a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم عامل</span> in what follows</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب لفظًا</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا غافرًا ذنوبَنا</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة غير مقصودة</span>: no particular individual intended</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب لفظًا</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا غافلًا</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد معرفة</span>, such as a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على ما يرفع به في محل نصب</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا زيدُ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة مقصودة</span>: a particular <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى</span> intended</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على ما يرفع به في محل نصب</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا رجلُ؛ يا رجلانِ؛ يا مسلمونَ</span></b></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Here <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد</span></b> means neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبيه بالمضاف</span>. It does not mean “one person”: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلان</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلمون</span> belong to this construction too. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا رجلانِ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الألف في محل نصب</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا مسلمونَ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الواو في محل نصب</span>. Do not rename either one <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span> merely from its final letter.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَا طَالِبًا عِلْمًا، اصْبِرْ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">You who seek knowledge, be patient.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نداء</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبًا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى شبيه بالمضاف منصوب بالفتحة؛ اسم فاعل يعمل في علمًا، وفاعله مستتر تقديره أنت</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمًا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لاسم الفاعل منصوب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اصبرْ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر مبني على السكون؛ فاعله مستتر أنت</span>.</p><p>Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا طالبَ العلمِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبَ</span> is now <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمِ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. Both versions have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب طالب</span>, but the reason for the following ending differs.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s4\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف حرف النداء</span></h2><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span> may be omitted with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبدَ اللهِ، اصبرْ</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يوسفُ، أعرِضْ عن هذا</span></b>. The calling context supplies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span>. Retain it with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظ الجلالة</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النكرة المقصودة</span></b>, such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا اللهُ، يا رجلُ</span></b>. The special form <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهمّ</span> has its own compensation, taught next.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L7-s1", "title": "Meaning and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحرف النداء</span>"}, {"id": "L7-s2", "title": "Classify before choosing the ending"}, {"id": "L7-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L7-s4", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف حرف النداء</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "7G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى</span> to its construction.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبيه بالمضاف</span> take <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب لفظي</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span> such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيد</span> and a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة مقصودة</span> such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span> addressing a specific man have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على ما يرفع به في محل نصب. غافرًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبيه بالمضاف</span> because it works in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذنوبَنا</span>; it is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا عبدَ اللهِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف منصوب لفظًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد مبني على الضم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة غير مقصودة بلا إضافة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا غافرًا ذنوبَنا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف مع تنوين على الأول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبيه بالمضاف منصوب لفظًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الواو</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا زيدُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم مبني على الضم في محل نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا رجلُ</span>: one particular man", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة مقصودة مبنية على الضم في محل نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة غير مقصودة منصوبة لفظًا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "7G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete the requested <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء</span>.", "sol": "<p>The intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى</span> matters. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلانِ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلمونَ</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة مقصودة</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الألف</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب. مفرد</span> in this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باب</span> excludes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه إضافة</span>; it does not exclude <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع. غير مقصود غافلًا</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب لفظي</span>.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "Address two particular men: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا <span class=\"blank\"></span></span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلانِ: فاعل مرفوع ليا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلَيْنِ: منصوب لفظًا لأنه مثنّى دائمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلانِ: مبني على الألف في محل نصب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "Address particular Muslims: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا <span class=\"blank\"></span></span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلمونَ: مبني على الواو في محل نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلمينَ: مجرور بفي محذوفة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلمونَ: خبر مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "Call without identifying a particular inattentive person", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا غافلُ: نكرة مقصودة</span> by definition", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا غافلٍ: مجرور بيا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا غافلًا: نكرة غير مقصودة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "7I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعرب</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا طالبا علما اصبر</span></b>, using <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبيه بالمضاف</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نداء؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبًا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى شبيه بالمضاف منصوب بالفتحة، وهو اسم فاعل عامل في علمًا، وفاعله مستتر أنت</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمًا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لاسم الفاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اصبرْ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر مبني على السكون؛ فاعله مستتر أنت</span>. Compare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبَ العلمِ</span>, where <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> instead requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ العلم</span>.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نداء يقوم مقام أدعو</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبِ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبُ: منادى مبني على الضم</span> with the requested construction", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبًا: منادى شبيه بالمضاف منصوب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علما</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمٌ: خبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمًا: مفعول به لاسم الفاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمِ: مضاف إليه مع بقاء تنوين طالبًا</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اصبر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اصبرُ: خبر مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اصبرَ: مفعول به لطالب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اصبرْ: فعل أمر، فاعله مستتر أنت</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "7I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Can the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نداء</span> be omitted under the taught <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>?", "sol": "<p>A calling context can license <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف حرف النداء</span> with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>. Under the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> used here it is retained with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النكرة المقصودة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظ الجلالة. اللهمّ</span> is a separate compensated form, not ordinary deletion.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يوسفُ، أعرضْ عن هذا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["Forbidden with every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span>", "Permitted with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span> in a calling context", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يوسف</span> must then become <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعولًا به منصوبًا لفظًا</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبدَ اللهِ، اصبرْ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["Forbidden with every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبد</span> must become <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوعًا</span>", "Permitted with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> in a calling context"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا رجلُ</span>: a particular man", "cells": [{"opts": ["Replace <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span> and keep the analysis", "Retain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النكرة المقصودة</span>", "Omit <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> freely under the same rule"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "7R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة زيد</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا زيدُ</span></b> different from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة زيد</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء زيدٌ</span></b>?", "sol": "<p>In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء, زيدُ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى مبني على الضم في محل نصب</span>. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء زيدٌ, زيدٌ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>. The visible vowel does not determine whether the ending is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>.</p>", "group": "7R|Review", "opts": ["Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> because a word precedes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيد</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا زيدُ</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الضم في محل نصب</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء زيدٌ</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>.", "Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span> because both have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "7-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنادى المفرد المعرفة مبني على ما يرفع به في محل نصب</span>.</b> Which interpretation of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد</span> fits <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا مسلمونَ</span></b>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد</span> is a constructional label in this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باب. مسلمونَ</span> can therefore be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع مذكر سالم</span> and still belong to this class of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى: مبني على الواو في محل نصب</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["Neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبيه بالمضاف</span>; it may still be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمعًا</span>.", "Exactly one Muslim, despite the ending.", "A word that cannot be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنيًّا</span>."], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "8", "title": "Forms of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنادى</span> and shortening with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الترخيم</span>", "short": "Lesson 8", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s1\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المتكلّم</span></h2><p>Four established forms occur when the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إلى ياء المتكلّم</span>:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Form</th><th>Example</th><th>What changed</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف الياء والاكتفاء بالكسرة</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا عبادِ</span></b></td><td>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> points to the omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثبوت الياء ساكنة</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا عباديْ</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساكنة</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثبوت الياء مفتوحة</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا عباديَ</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفتوحة</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلب الكسرة فتحة والياء ألفًا</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا حسرتَا</span></b></td><td>Compare the meaning “my regret!”</td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عباد</span></b> = servants; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسرة</span></b> = regret. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا عبادِ</span> does not turn the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى</span> into <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span>. Its relation is still <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> to an expressed or understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الترخيم</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الترخيم</span></b> removes the end of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى</span> for <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التخفيف</span></b>. Recognise <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا فاطمَ</span></b> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمة</span>. Use these categories here:</p><ul><li>What ends in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span>, such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عائشة</span> → <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا عائشُ</span></b>.</li><li>A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم مذكر، زائد على ثلاثة أحرف، غير مركّب</span></b>, such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جعفر</span> → <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا جعفُ</span></b>.</li></ul><p>Under these <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط, زينب</span> does not meet the second category's <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكر شرط, زيد</span> does not exceed three letters, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبد الله</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مركّب</span>. Do not extend this practice by dropping the final letter of any name.</p><p>Two endings are permitted: preserve the <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركة أصلية</span></b>, which is preferred, or use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حارث</span> → <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا حارِ / يا حارُ</span></b>. The first retains the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ر</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حارث</span>; the second treats the shortened form with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span>. a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span> asking for the preferred form is different from one asking what is permissible.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s3\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهمّ</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهمّ</span></b> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة نداء</span>: its origin is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا اللهُ</span></b>, with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ميم مشدّدة</span> compensating for the omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف النداء</span>. It is not ordinary deletion with no replacement.</p><p>Also recognise <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهمّ إلا أن يكون كذا</span></b>, introducing a rare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span>, and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهمّ نعم</span></b>, expressing the respondent's certainty. These uses do not make <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلا</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم أحرف نداء</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s4\">Worked comparison</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا عبادِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى مضاف منصوب بفتحة مقدّرة، وهو مضاف؛ ياء المتكلّم محذوفة، وهي في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>. The retained <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> signals that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا حارِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى مرخّم،</span> with the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركة أصلية</span> retained from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حارث</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> is not assigned by a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>. Identify what the form preserves before interpreting a vowel.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L8-s1", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المتكلّم</span>"}, {"id": "L8-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الترخيم</span>"}, {"id": "L8-s3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهمّ</span>"}, {"id": "L8-s4", "title": "Worked comparison"}], "items": [{"id": "8G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Identify the form of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المتكلّم</span>.", "sol": "<p>These are four established <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صور</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنادى المضاف إلى ياء المتكلّم</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> may be omitted with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> retained, remain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساكنة</span>, remain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفتوحة</span>, or be changed to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> with the preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> changed to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>. None makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا عبادِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف نون المثنّى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف الياء والاكتفاء بالكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ المنادى بيا</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا عباديْ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلب الياء ألفًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثبوت الياء ساكنة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الياء علامة تثنية</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا عباديَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف الياء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثبوت الياء مفتوحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم الاسم</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا حسرتَا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين النصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف المثنّى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلب الكسرة فتحة والياء ألفًا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "8G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Apply the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ترخيم شروط</span> taught here.", "sol": "<p>The categories used here are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المختوم بالتاء</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم مذكر زائد على ثلاثة أحرف غير مركّب. فاطمة</span> meets the first, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جعفر</span> the second. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيد</span> fails the length <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبد الله</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مركّب. زينب</span> does not satisfy the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكر شرط</span> in this treatment.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["Eligible only because it has three letters", "Eligible: ends in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span>", "Ineligible: every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span> is excluded"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جعفر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["Ineligible: no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span>", "Eligible: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم مذكر زائد على ثلاثة أحرف غير مركّب</span>", "Eligible because it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مركّب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["Eligible because three letters are sufficient here", "Excluded by the length <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>", "Excluded because it ends in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبد الله</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["Excluded because it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مركّب</span>", "Eligible because its final letter can always be removed", "Eligible because it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "8I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "From <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حارث</span></b>, choose the preferred <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ترخيم</span> retaining <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحركة الأصلية</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا حارِ</span></b> preserves the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ر</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حارث</span> and is preferred. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا حارُ</span></b> is also permitted, but is not the answer to a request to retain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحركة الأصلية. تنوين الجرّ</span> is not this construction.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا حارُ</span> is the only permitted form", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا حارِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا حارٍ</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين الجرّ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "8I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Correct the analysis of these forms.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا عبادِ</span> preserves the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> associated with a deleted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المتكلّم</span>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى</span> is still <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب تقديرًا. اللهمّ</span> compensates for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ميم مشدّدة</span>. Before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم</span> it can signal certainty; before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلا</span> it can signal the rarity of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span>.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "“<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبادِ</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا عبادِ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> because of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>.”", "cells": [{"opts": ["Correct: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>.", "It remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى مضاف منصوب تقديرًا</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> points to omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span>.", "It is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم لأن الياء حذفت</span>."], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهمّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر بمعنى نادى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة نداء؛ الميم المشددة عوض عن يا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف استثناء</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهمّ نعم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["Requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم</span> to become <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نداء</span>", "Always expresses grief", "Expresses certainty in the answer"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهمّ إلا أن يكون كذا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["Makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلا</span> a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span>", "Forbids every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span>", "Introduces a rare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "8R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which distinguishes <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يوسفُ، أعرضْ</span></b> from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا حارِ</span></b>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يوسفُ</span> is the full <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> omitted in context. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا حارِ</span> retains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> and removes the end of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حارث</span> through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ترخيم</span>. Name what is omitted before classifying the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span>.</p>", "group": "8R|Review", "opts": ["The first omits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف النداء</span>; the second shortens the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى</span> itself.", "Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> because of a deleted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span>.", "Both omit only the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "8-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الترخيم حذف آخر المنادى للتخفيف</span>.</b> What was removed in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا فاطمَ</span></b>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمة</span> loses its final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ترخيم. يا</span> remains, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمَ</span> preserves the preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركة أصلية</span>. This is deletion within the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف حرف النداء</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["The final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمة</span>", "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نداء يا</span>", "A written <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماضٍ</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "9", "title": "Calling for help, expressing wonder, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الندبة</span>", "short": "Lesson 9", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s1\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاستغاثة</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاستغاثة</span></b> calls someone to help another. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أركان</span> are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف الاستغاثة</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> only), <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستغاث</span></b> (the helper called), and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستغاث له / لأجله</span></b> (the one for whose sake help is sought).</p><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَا لَلْأَمِيرِ لِلْمَظْلُومِينَ</span>!</b> <span class=\"gl\">O ruler, help the wronged!</span></div><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستغاث</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفتوحة</span></b>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستغاث له</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكسورة</span></b>. Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف جرّ</span>. Thus the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَ</span> does not give <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأميرِ</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Construction</th><th>Read the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ل</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا لَلأميرِ ويا لَلمسلمينَ لِلمظلومينَ</span></b></td><td>Another <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستغاث</span> with repeated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا: لَ</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا لَلأميرِ ولِلمسلمينَ لِلمظلومينَ</span></b></td><td>Another <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستغاث</span> without repeated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا: لِ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Do not identify every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِ</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستغاث له</span>: it can introduce a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف مستغاث</span> when <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> is not repeated. The whole sequence settles the role.</p><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> can replace <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام المستغاث</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا زيدَا</span></b>; at <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وقف</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا زيدَاهْ</span></b>. Do not combine that replacement with the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ل</span> it replaces.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء التعجّب</span></h2><p>This expresses wonder at <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المتعجّب منه</span></b>. It follows the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاستغاثة</span> pattern: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا لَلقرآنِ</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا قرآنَاهْ</span></b>. Another pattern puts <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المتعجّب منه</span> in the position of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستغاث له</span> while omitting <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستغاث</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا لِلقرآنِ</span></b>. Both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِ</span> are recognised here, with different analyses.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s3\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الندبة</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الندبة</span></b> expresses grief. Use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وا</span></b>, or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span></b> when there is no confusion with ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء</span>. The basic <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحكام المنادى</span> remain: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وا زيدُ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء في محل نصب</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وا عبدَ اللهِ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب لفظي</span> because it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>.</p><p>An <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الندبة</span></b> may be added: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وا زيدَا</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاء السكت</span></b> may follow it at <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وقف</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وا رأسَاهْ، وا ويلَاهْ</span></b>: grief for one's head or woe. This <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاء</span> is not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> meaning “his”. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> in these patterns is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين النصب</span> or proof of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تثنية</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَا لَلْأَمِيرِ لِلْمَظْلُومِينَ</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف استغاثة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَـ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام المستغاث، حرف جر مفتوح</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأميرِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستغاث مجرور باللام، وعلامة جره الكسرة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِـ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام المستغاث له، حرف جر مكسور</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المظلومينَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستغاث له مجرور بالياء لأنه جمع مذكر سالم</span>. The first expression names whom help is sought from; the second names whom it is for.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L9-s1", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاستغاثة</span>"}, {"id": "L9-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء التعجّب</span>"}, {"id": "L9-s3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الندبة</span>"}, {"id": "L9-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "9G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا لَلأميرِ لِلمظلومينَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف الاستغاثة. لَ</span> introduces <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستغاث الأميرِ</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِ</span> introduces <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستغاث له المظلومينَ</span>. Both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف جرّ. المظلومين</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالياء لأنه جمع مذكر سالم</span>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> remains.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف استغاثة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأميرِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستغاث مجرور بلام مفتوحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستغاث له منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المظلومينَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى مبني على الضم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستغاث له مجرور بلام مكسورة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستغاث منصوب بالفتحة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة جرّ المظلومين</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف النون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفتحة على لام الاستغاثة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الياء لأنه جمع مذكر سالم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "9G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ل</span> while keeping the indicated meaning.", "sol": "<p>With repeated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span>, use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ويا لَلمسلمين</span></b>. Without repeated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span>, use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ولِلمسلمين</span></b>. In both, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسلمين</span> remains a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف مستغاث</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المظلومين</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستغاث له</span>. The second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِ</span> does not automatically change who is being asked to help.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا لَلأميرِ ويا <span class=\"blank\"></span> المسلمينَ لِلمظلومينَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لُـ</span>: every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستغاث</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَـ</span>: repeated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> before another <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستغاث</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِـ: يا</span> never affects the pattern"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا لَلأميرِ و<span class=\"blank\"></span> المسلمينَ لِلمظلومينَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لُـ: جمع</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِـ</span>: another <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستغاث</span>, without repeated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَـ</span>: repetition of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> is irrelevant"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "9I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Distinguish the recognised <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء</span> patterns.", "sol": "<p>Both <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا لَلقرآن</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا لِلقرآن</span></b> are recognised for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء التعجب</span>, but their structural accounts differ. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وا عبدَ اللهِ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ندبة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبدَ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف منصوب لفظًا</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهِ مضاف إليه. وا</span> is not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف الاستغاثة</span>, which is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> only.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا لَلقرآنِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء تعجّب؛ المتعجّب منه في موضع المستغاث</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ترخيم القرآن</span>", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام مفتوحة</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب للقرآن</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا لِلقرآنِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء تعجّب؛ المتعجّب منه في موضع المستغاث له مع حذف المستغاث</span>", "Impossible because every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ل</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفتوحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء عادي مع حذف الألف</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وا عبدَ اللهِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ندبة؛ كل منادى مبني على الضم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استغاثة بحرف وا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ندبة؛ المنادى المضاف منصوب لفظًا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "9I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وا رأسَاهْ</span></b> at <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وقف</span>, what is the final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span>?", "sol": "<p>The final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هْ</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاء السكت</span></b>, added at <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وقف</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الندبة</span>. It is not a possessive <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> is likewise part of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ندبة</span> form, not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة تثنية</span>.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر</span> meaning “his”", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاء السكت</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الندبة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر</span> written as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "9R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which comparison is correct?", "sol": "<p>The basic <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحكام المنادى</span> remain in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ندبة. زيد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد عَلَم</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء في محل نصب. عبد الله</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبد</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب لفظي. يا</span> may replace <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وا</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ندبة</span> only when confusion with ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء</span> is avoided.</p>", "group": "9R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ندبة</span> removes all the ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحكام المنادى</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وا زيدُ</span> keeps <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الضم في محل نصب</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وا عبدَ اللهِ</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب لفظي</span> through its type as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وا</span> makes every following word <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرورًا</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "9-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تُكسر لام المستغاث المعطوف إذا لم تتكرر يا</span>.</b> Apply it to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا لَلأميرِ ولِلمسلمينَ لِلمظلومينَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span> and absence of repeated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> explain <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ولِلمسلمين</span></b>. The final <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِلمظلومين</span></b> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستغاث له</span>. Both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء</span> after the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرورة</span> despite the different roles.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسلمين</span> must be the only <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستغاث له</span> because its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكسورة</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأمير</span> becomes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوبًا لأن لامه مفتوحة</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسلمين</span> is another <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستغاث</span>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكسورة</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> was not repeated."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "10", "title": "When the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span> is omitted", "short": "Lesson 10", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s1\">Four <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قياسيّ</span> settings</h2><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوبًا</span> even when its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف وجوبًا</span>. Learn the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> that license the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span>:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Setting</th><th>Example</th><th>What to recognise</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال تسدّ مسدّ الخبر</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دُعَائِي رَبِّي مُسْتَيْقِنًا</span></b></td><td>My calling on my Lord is while I am certain</td></tr><tr><td>Gradual increase or decrease</td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَصَدَّقْ بِدِرْهَمٍ فَصَاعِدًا</span></b></td><td>Give a dirham, then upwards</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام للتوبيخ</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَقَاعِدًا وَقَدْ أُقِيمَتِ الصَّلَاةُ؟</span></b></td><td>Still sitting when the prayer has been established?</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأكيد مضمون الجملة</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خَالِدٌ أَبُوكَ عَطُوفًا</span></b></td><td>Khalid is your father, being affectionate</td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستيقن</span></b> = certain; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصدّق</span></b> = give charity; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطوف</span></b> = affectionate. The first example does not describe <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دعاء</span> as “certain”: the person making the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دعاء</span> is certain. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> serving this function may also be a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقربُ ما يكونُ العبدُ من ربّه وهو ساجدٌ</span></b> uses <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وهو ساجدٌ</span></b> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال تسدّ مسدّ الخبر</span>, expressing that the nearness occurs while he is prostrating. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> fills the place otherwise requiring <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>, without becoming a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع</span>.</p><p>For gradual change, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> must be accompanied by <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فـ</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثمّ</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فـ</span> is more frequent. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فصاعدًا</span>, understand <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فَزِدْ صاعدًا</span></b> or a corresponding meaning of increasing. Do not drop the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ف</span> and apply this precise rule unchanged.</p><p>For <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التوبيخ</span>, a suitable <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَبَقِيتَ قاعدًا؟</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَلَبِثْتَ قاعدًا؟</span></b>. The following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وقد أقيمت الصلاة</span> explains why the sitting is rebuked. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة</span> signals <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاستفهام</span>; it does not itself act like a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب للحال</span>.</p><p>For <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأكيد مضمون الجملة</span>, the meaning of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> must accord with the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>, and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبتدأ والخبر معرفتان جامدتان</span></b>. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد أبوك عطوفًا, خالد</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبوك</span> meet those <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>. Do not generalise the rule to every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> following any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة اسمية</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سماعيّ</span> expressions</h2><p>Also recognise <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هَنِيئًا لَكَ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَالِمًا غَانِمًا</span></b> as established expressions with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف عامل</span> in this treatment. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هنيئًا</span></b> wishes pleasant enjoyment; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سالمًا غانمًا</span></b> wishes safety and success. Their established use does not remove the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> of the four <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قياسيّ</span> patterns.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَصَدَّقْ بِدِرْهَمٍ فَصَاعِدًا</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصدّقْ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر مبني على السكون؛ فاعله مستتر أنت</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">درهمٍ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بالكسرة، والجار والمجرور متعلق بتصدّق</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء</span></b> accompanies the gradual progression. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاعدًا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوب بالفتحة، عامله محذوف وجوبًا، تقديره زِدْ</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فزد صاعدًا</span>. Do not make <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاعدًا</span> a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت مجرور</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">درهم</span>.</p><p>Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَجُرْأَةً على المعاصي؟</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَقَاعِدًا وقد أُقيمت الصلاة؟</span></b>. Both express <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التوبيخ</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرأةً</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> used as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>, while <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاعدًا</span> describes a state and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>. Shared meaning does not force a shared grammatical role.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L10-s1", "title": "Four <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قياسيّ</span> settings"}, {"id": "L10-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سماعيّ</span> expressions"}, {"id": "L10-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "10G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف العامل</span>.", "sol": "<p>The four settings are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سدّ مسدّ الخبر</span>, gradual increase/decrease, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام للتوبيخ</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأكيد مضمون الجملة</span>. In the last, meaning must agree and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبتدأ والخبر</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفتين جامدتين. مستيقنًا</span> describes the person praying, not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دعاء</span> itself.</p>", "group": "10G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دعائي ربّي مستيقنًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال تسدّ مسدّ الخبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ترخيم عَلَم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز عدد</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصدّق بدرهم فصاعدًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء نكرة مقصودة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختصاص</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيادة بتدريج مع الفاء</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقاعدًا وقد أقيمت الصلاة؟</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استغاثة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام للتوبيخ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد أبوك عطوفًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأكيد مضمون الجملة بشروطه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال بلا أي شرط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق لأنه مصدر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "10G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصدّقْ بدرهمٍ فصاعدًا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصدّقْ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر فاعله أنت</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدرهمٍ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور متعلق بتصدّق</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاعدًا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوب بالفتحة بعامل محذوف وجوبًا تقديره زِدْ</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فزد صاعدًا</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فـ</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثمّ</span> accompanies this particular gradual-change pattern; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فـ</span> is more frequent.</p>", "group": "10G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">درهمٍ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بالباء</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاعدًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت مجرور لدرهم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوب بعامل محذوف وجوبًا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التقدير المناسب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا صاعدُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ درهمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فزِدْ صاعدًا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء أو ثمّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["Required accompaniment for this gradual-change pattern", "Both forbidden with this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>", "Both always make <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاعدًا مفعولًا به</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "10I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct: “Any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> after any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة اسمية</span> allows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف العامل</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأكيد مضمون الجملة</span>.”", "sol": "<p>The rule requires agreement between <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الحال</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الجملة</span>, plus <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبتدأ والخبر معرفتان جامدتان</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد أبوك عطوفًا</span> is the taught model. A superficially similar sequence does not automatically meet those <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>.</p>", "group": "10I|Independent", "opts": ["Correct: no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> concern the two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء</span>.", "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> is that both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبتدأ والخبر</span> be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرتين مشتقتين</span>.", "The meanings must agree, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبتدأ والخبر</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفتين جامدتين</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "10I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Read <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقاعدا وقد أقيمت الصلاة؟</span></b> Supply the key analysis.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاعدًا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوب بعامل محذوف وجوبًا</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام للتوبيخ</span>. A suitable <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبقيتَ قاعدًا؟</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألبثتَ قاعدًا؟</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد أقيمت الصلاة</span></b> supplies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> for the rebuke; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة</span> does not itself act as a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب للحال</span>.</p>", "group": "10I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاعدا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاعدٌ: فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاعدًا: حال منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاعدٍ: مجرور بالهمزة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامله</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة الاستفهام كحرف نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصلاة هي العامل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف وجوبًا؛ تقدير مناسب: أبقيتَ قاعدًا؟</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد أقيمت الصلاة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["Changes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة</span> into <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>", "Makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاعدًا</span> a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span>", "Explains the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> making the sitting a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توبيخ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "10R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجرأةً على المعاصي؟</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقاعدًا وقد أقيمت الصلاة؟</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرأة</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> used as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>, whereas <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاعد</span> describes a state and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>. The omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عوامل</span> are understood through different constructions even though both expressions rebuke.</p>", "group": "10R|Review", "opts": ["Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span> because both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>.", "Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> because every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>.", "Both express <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التوبيخ</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرأةً</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق, قاعدًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "10-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يشترط في الحال المؤكدة لمضمون الجملة أن يتفق معناها ومعنى الجملة</span>.</b> Which adds the other required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>?", "sol": "<p>For this construction, require agreement of meaning <b>and</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبتدأ والخبر معرفتين جامدتين</span>. Do not transfer that specific <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> to every kind of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن يكون المبتدأ والخبر معرفتين جامدتين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن يكون الحال مضافًا دائمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن يكون المبتدأ والخبر نكرتين</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "R", "title": "Module review: identify the relationship and justify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span>", "short": "Module review", "html": "<p>Analyse before choosing. For a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محذوف عامل</span>, supply a suitable <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span>. For a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> expression, give both its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل إعرابي</span>. In connected passages, follow each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> back to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرجع</span>.</p>", "secs": [], "items": [{"id": "A1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> in each specified analysis.", "sol": "<p>The first two are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل معنوي: الابتداء</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلوّ المضارع</span>. The short answer has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> recovered from context <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جوازًا</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب الاشتغال</span> example has an omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> explained by the following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُه</span>, whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span> already fills its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> position.</p>", "group": "A|Distinctions", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ معلّمٌ</span>: use the main account", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الابتداء يرفع المبتدأ والخبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ مقدّر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ المحذوفة تنصب خالدًا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأُ خالدٌ: عامل رفع يقرأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلوّه من الناصب والجازم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم محذوفة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد يجزمه</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماذا قرأت؟: كتابًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ محذوف جوازًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ابتداء ينصب كتابًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أدعو محذوف وجوبًا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ قرأتُه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه تنصب الكتاب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل محذوف وجوبًا يفسّره المذكور ينصب الكتاب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأت المذكور له مفعولان هما الكتاب وه</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "A2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the accurate correction for each overgeneralisation.", "sol": "<p>Identify the role, construction, and strength of the rule separately. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاعدًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا زيدُ</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>; the contextual short answer permits expression of its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجحان</span> does not forbid the alternative.</p>", "group": "A|Distinctions", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل نصب بعد استفهام مفعول مطلق</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل استفهام حرف جرّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل منصوب منادى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقاعدًا؟</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>, unlike <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجرأةً؟</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل ضمة علامة رفع</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا زيدُ</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الضم في محل نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضمة لا تأتي في العربية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء زيدٌ</span> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل حذف واجب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يجوز حذف أي فعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا</span> answering <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماذا قرأت؟</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف جائز</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الابتداء فعل محذوف دائمًا</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راجح</span> means <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["A preferred <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> can coexist with a permitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جائز</span> is obligatory", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راجح</span> is forbidden"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "B1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the endings for the specified meanings.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا رجلُ</span></b> addresses a particular man. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن الطلابَ</span></b> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختصاص</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هلّا الكتابَ قرأته</span></b> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> in this pattern; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أالكتابَ قرأته</span></b> prefers it without forbidding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا طالبَ العلمِ</span></b> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and corrections", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "Call one particular man: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا <span class=\"blank\"></span></span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلًا</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة غير مقصودة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن <span class=\"blank\"></span> نطلب العلم</span>: specify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلابُ: منصوب بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلابِ: جرّ بنحن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلابَ: اختصاص</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هلّا <span class=\"blank\"></span> قرأتَه؟</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابِ: جرّ بهلّا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ: وجوب النصب في الاشتغال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابُ: وجوب الرفع بعد هلّا</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أ<span class=\"blank\"></span> قرأتَه؟</span>: choose the preferred <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاشتغال</span> form", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ: رجحان النصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابُ: الرفع وحده جائز</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابِ: الجرّ واجب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا طالبَ <span class=\"blank\"></span></span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمِ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمُ: نائب فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمَ: مفعول به مع الإضافة المطلوبة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "B2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Distinguish the losses or replacements.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا عبادِ</span> omits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المتكلّم, يا حارِ</span> shortens <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حارث</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهمّ</span> compensates for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ميم مشدّدة</span>. In the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاستغاثة</span> form, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> replaces <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام المستغاث</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاء</span> occurs at <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وقف</span>. Similar-looking deletions need different explanations.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and corrections", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا عبادِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المتكلّم محذوفة والكسرة باقية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف عامل جزم منادى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف آخر عَلَم للترخيم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا حارِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ترخيم حارث مع إبقاء الحركة الأصلية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف يا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ بمن محذوفة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهمّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ميم مشدّدة عوض عن حرف النداء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ميم علامة جمع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا زيدَاهْ</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاستغاثة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين نصب ثم فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف عوض عن لام المستغاث، ثم هاء عند الوقف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف مثنّى ثم ضمير ه</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "C1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا خالد، الصبر الصبر. نحن الطلاب نطلب العلم. الدرس حفظته</span>.</b> Use a named <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى, إغراء, اختصاص</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب الاشتغال</span>. Complete the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا خالدُ، الصبرَ الصبرَ. نحنُ الطلابَ نطلبُ العلمَ. الدرسَ حفظتُهُ</span>.</b></p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نداء؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدُ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى مبني على الضم في محل نصب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصبرَ الأول</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لفعل محذوف وجوبًا تقديره الزم؛ فاعله مستتر أنت</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الثاني</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي منصوب</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع مبتدأ</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلابَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب على الاختصاص بفعل محذوف وجوبًا تقديره أخصّ، فاعله مستتر أنا</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نطلبُ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع، فاعله مستتر نحن؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة نطلب العلم</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرسَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لفعل محذوف وجوبًا تقديره حفظتُ، يفسّره المذكور</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حفظتُ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماضٍ مبني على السكون، والتاء ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل نصب مفعول به يعود إلى الدرس</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة حفظته</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفسيرية لا محل لها</span>. The requested <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> analysis prevents confusing it with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرسُ حفظته</span>, whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> would be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبرًا</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نداء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جرّ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدُ: منادى مبني على الضم في محل نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا: نكرة غير مقصودة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ: فاعل ليا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصبر الأول</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصبرُ: مبتدأ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصبرَ: مفعول به لفعل محذوف وجوبًا تقديره الزم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصبرِ: مضاف إليه لخالد</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصبر الثاني</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصبرُ: خبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصبرَ: توكيد لفظي منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصبرِ: مجرور بالواو</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف اختصاص</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ليا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع مبتدأ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلاب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلابِ: مضاف إليه لنحن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلابَ: مفعول به لأخصّ المحذوف على الاختصاص</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطلابُ: منادى</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نطلب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نطلبْ: مجزوم بنحن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نطلبَ: منصوب بالطلاب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نطلبُ: مضارع مرفوع، فاعله مستتر نحن</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمُ: فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمِ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمَ: مفعول به لنطلب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة نطلب العلم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر نحن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفسيرية لا محل لها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرسِ: مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرسَ: مفعول به لفعل محذوف يفسّره حفظتُه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرسُ: مبتدأ</span> in the requested <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> analysis"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حفظت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حفظتْ: حرف نداء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حفظتُ: فعل ماضٍ مبني على السكون، والتاء فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حفظتَ: فعل أمر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل يعود إلى نحن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه لخالد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به يعود إلى الدرس</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة حفظته</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال من يا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر للدرس المنصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفسيرية لا محل لها في هذا التحليل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "C2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماذا قرأت؟ قال سعيد: كتابا. ثم قال: يا لَلأميرِ ولِلمسلمينَ لِلمظلومينَ</span>.</b> Follow the relationships.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا</span></b> answers <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماذا قرأتَ</span>, so estimate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span> and analyse <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف جائز</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span></b> introduces <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاستغاثة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأميرِ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستغاث مجرور بالكسرة</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَ</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسلمينَ</span></b> is another <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستغاث, معطوف</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِ</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> is not repeated; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالياء</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المظلومينَ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستغاث له مجرور بالياء</span>. Repeating <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> restores <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ويا لَلمسلمين</span></b>.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا: مفعول به لقرأتُ المحذوف جوازًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٍ: مضاف إليه لسعيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٌ: فاعل لقال</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأمير</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستغاث له منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستغاث مجرور بالكسرة بلام مفتوحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى مبني على الضم بلا لام</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسلمين</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لام الاستغاثة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف مستغاث؛ اللام مكسورة لعدم تكرار يا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لقال</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المظلومين</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف على سعيد مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستغاث له مجرور بالياء</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "Replacing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ولِلمسلمين</span> with repeated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ويا لِلمسلمين</span> under the same repeated-<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> rule", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ووا لُلمسلمين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ويا لَلمسلمين</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "D1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Read the Arabic judgements and select the consequence.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجوز</span></b> expresses permission; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يترجّح</span></b> expresses preference; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني ... في محل نصب</span></b> separates the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> from its position. These distinctions prevent false corrections of valid alternatives.</p>", "group": "D|Read Arabic grammatical language", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجوز إعمال الأول أو الثاني</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span> must precede both.", "Only the second exists.", "Both accounts are permitted; specify one for a detailed analysis."], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يترجّح النصب إذا كان العامل فعل طلب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجرّ أولى من النصب</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النصب راجح، وليس معنى ذلك امتناع الرفع</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النصب واجب والرفع ممتنع</span>."], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنادى مبني على ما يرفع به في محل نصب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة البناء لا تغيّر محل النصب إلى رفع</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل ضمة هنا علامة رفع</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لأي منادى من الإعراب</span>."], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "D2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose a complete <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> rather than an overgeneralisation.", "sol": "<p>Keep each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> attached to its own rule: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فـ/ثمّ</span> for gradual change; agreement of meaning and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفتان جامدتان</span> for the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأكيد الحال</span>; absence of ambiguity for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ندبة. معنى الإشارة</span> can govern <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> without changing the word type of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الإشارة</span>.</p>", "group": "D|Read Arabic grammatical language", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف عامل حال الزيادة أو النقص بتدريج</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصحبها الفاء أو ثمّ، والفاء أكثر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل حال بعد اسم مقدار لها الحكم نفسه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجب حذف الفاء وثمّ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال المؤكدة لمضمون الجملة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبتدأ والخبر نكرتان دائمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يتفق المعنيان، والمبتدأ والخبر معرفتان جامدتان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكفي وجود أي جملة اسمية</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا في الندبة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجوز بلا اعتبار للمعنى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ممنوعة دائمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجوز إذا أُمن اللبس بالنداء المحض</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى الفعل في اسم الإشارة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجزم كل فعل بعده</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحوّل اسم الإشارة إلى فعل ماضٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يمكن أن ينصب الحال مع بقاء الكلمة اسم إشارة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}], "after": "<h2 class=\"sec\">Ready to continue?</h2><p>You are ready when you can distinguish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل معنوي</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل محذوف</span>; identify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التنازع</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاشتغال</span>; explain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحذير، الإغراء،</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاختصاص</span>; give <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب المنادى لفظًا ومحلًّا</span>; and justify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف عامل الحال</span>.</p><p>If a wrong answer confuses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راجح</span>, revisit the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> before repeating the question. If it confuses two roles with the same ending, name the relationship before looking at the vowel.</p>"}], "revisit": "<ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل معنوي</span> versus <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل محذوف</span>: Lessons 1–2.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span> versus <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> versus <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span>: Lessons 3–5 and 10.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> references and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب</span> versus <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راجح</span>: Lesson 6.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> versus <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النداء</span>: Lessons 7–8.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام المستغاث</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاء السكت</span>: Lesson 9.</li></ul>"};
